## Volume 5 — Database Architecture, Knowledge Schema & Data Engineering
### Version 2.0
### Status: Official Engineering Specification

---

# 1. Purpose

Data is the foundation of AI Career OS.

Artificial Intelligence is only as intelligent as the data it can reason over.

This specification defines how information is stored, related, queried, versioned, and evolved throughout the platform.

The database is not merely storage.

It is the persistent memory of the operating system.

---

# 2. Database Philosophy

The database must satisfy six principles.

## Human-Centered

Data exists to improve user outcomes.

Never collect information without purpose.

---

## AI-Native

Every model should support AI reasoning.

Relationships are first-class citizens.

---

## Knowledge-Driven

Store entities.

Connect entities.

Reason over relationships.

---

## Extensible

New careers, skills, AI tools, and technologies should be added without redesigning existing tables.

---

## Versioned

Content changes.

Roadmaps evolve.

Recommendations improve.

User progress must remain valid.

---

## Observable

Every meaningful change should be measurable.

---

